Ham::RTTY 0.01

Pure-Perl ITA2 RTTY text, timing, AFSK WAV and debug MIDI toolkit.
Perl 5.20 or later; core runtime modules; PDL 2.081 or later optional.

perl Makefile.PL
make
make test

